'''The Last Runestone''' is an area located in the [[Thalassian Highlands]]. A fortified camp lies next to the runestone, where Ranger-General [[Halduron Brightwing]] leads a coalition of [[Alliance]] forces to stem the tide of [[Scourge]] from the [[Scourged Pass]].

